 "method": {
  "class": "CPU-only asymptotically valid prediction-powered confidence interval for a population mean with a fixed predictor, fixed labeled set and fixed unlabeled set",
  "description": "Candidate maps (n, N, alpha, labeled Y/Yhat, unlabeled Yhat) to a (1-alpha) interval for E[Y]; may recalibrate or cross-fit a control variate g(Yhat) from the labeled data (influence-function / debiased-ML style augmentation, variance refinements) and is compared against classical, PPI (lambda=1) and PPI++ at maintained nominal coverage. Scope: mean estimand, iid labeled/unlabeled draws from one population, alpha=0.05; no claim for other estimands or covariate shift."
 },
